  "plain": "In 1947, near the town of Roswell in New Mexico, something is said to have crashed, and many people believe it was a craft from somewhere else. A researcher who goes by UAPGerb, speaking on a podcast hosted by Jesse Michels, says that bodies from that crash were flown to Wright-Patterson, an Air Force base in Ohio, and kept there on ice. If true, it would mean the military had held non-human bodies since the 1940s."
